WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Tokyo Veil lost the sky years ago. Tonight, it loses its last quiet street.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.500
Stay close. The shard is reacting to the grid surge again.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
If the moon archive wakes before dawn, every district light will answer to it.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:20.000
Then we move before dawn and cut a path no scanner can predict.
